Strength norms (app/src/main/resources/dev/gzclp/tracker/engine/strength-norms.txt)

  Fitted by tools/strength-norms.py from the meet results of the
  OpenPowerlifting project, https://www.openpowerlifting.org, at the commit
  named in the file's header. A copy of the data is at
  https://gitlab.com/openpowerlifting/opl-data

  OpenPowerlifting data is contributed to the public domain. Only fitted
  curves are shipped: no lifter's name or result is included, and none of the
  project's source code (AGPL) is used or included.
